'''Magical Pokémon Journey: Rockabye Pokémon''' is the twenty-eighth monthly issue released by [[VIZ Media]] of the [[Magical Pokémon Journey]] manga created by [[Yumi Tsukirino]]. It contains the 42nd and 43rd chapters of the manga. The chapters originally released in this book were later re-released as part of {{Vol|Magical Pokémon Journey|7}}. As a bonus, it contained a fold-out color poster which was not part of the regular volume.

